        "created_at": "2013-08-01T15:51:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For those who are coming to Gen Con, I'm planning to put a sticker on my badge with \"Rabit on &gt;G forum\" so folks can connect me to my forum name. I should have extra stickers at the &gt;G booth, if anyone doesn't have access to some and is interested in doing the same thing. (I'm only there half-time, this year, as we have friends in town for the Con.)</p>",
